-* Input: A volumetric dataset (e.g., 3D scans, hypertextured meshes, or fractals) with resolutions such as $8192^3$ or $16384^3$ [S1, unofficial].
-* Output: A rendered image at interactive rates (20-90 fps) [S1, unofficial].
